ra il Re Scimmia, creatura onnipotente che da cinquecento anni era imprigionato in una gabbia di ghiaccio per volere degli dei. Con l'aiuto del Re Scimmia, il bimbo ora rappresenta l'unica speranza per il suo villaggio.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"这是一个需要英雄的时代","language":"zh-CN"},"releaseDate":"2015-07-10","status":"Released","rating":6.932,"ratingCount":307,"genres":["Fantasy","Animazione","Commedia"],"countries":["China"],"facts":{"Runtime":"89m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":2936880,"name":"Zhang Lei","role":"孙悟空（配音）","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eCVDOBX3rLdmw5R00sB3z4NcIIh.jpg"},{"id":1490571,"name":"Lin Zijie","role":"江流儿（配音）"},{"id":4048708,"name":"Wu Wenlun","role":"法明（配音）"},{"id":1490572,"name":"Tong Zirong","role":"混沌（配音）"},{"id":1621709,"name":"Liu Jiurong","role":"猪八戒（配音）"},{"id":4048715,"name":"Wu Di","role":"老板娘(女妖)（配音）"},{"id":1621710,"name":"Liu Beichen","role":"山神（配音）","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e67ZDBf8V5TIPbmmVkAR39GvaQt.jpg"},{"id":3171093,"name":"Zhao Qianjing","role":"江流儿爸爸（配音）","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6QRgZZZhwee5md1W5kgeCEScvQI.jpg"},{"id":1621712,"name":"Zhou Shuai","role":"江流儿妈妈（配音）","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vwkXA2UojpN7qvnHToI9K5vQ78B.jpg"},{"id":3882419,"name":"Kuixing Teng","role":"混沌（配音）","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4odB2nMZmHfBwjc8pXpHyraD17Y.jpg"},{"id":3718858,"name":"Zhang Xin","role":"孙悟空（配音）","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vkxwijWjFmkQo7sSOsKCsPTfE6a.jpg"},{"id":2339332,"name":"Zhao Mingzhou","role":"法明（配音）","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pXUlknCuP3u5FIfC7DluQzsKWAz.jpg"},{"id":3954369,"name":"Li Yufeng","role":"店小二(男妖)（配音）","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zF6B7KSenPt363YoaXISQBHAfya.jpg"},{"id":5760482,"name":"陈哲","role":"山神（配音）"},{"id":1396090,"name":"Cui Jie","role":"猪八戒（配音）","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2puSj4MkAtlvespL6mKvGAC5w8J.jpg"},{"id":2895811,"name":"Jing Ji","role":"江流儿（配音）"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Monkey King:  The Hero Is Back","overview":"Alcune mostruose creature attaccano un piccolo villaggio e un bambino per salvarsi scappa verso le vicine montagne. Inconsapevolmente, il piccolo libera il Re Scimmia, creatura onnipotente che da cinquecento anni era imprigionato in una gabbia di ghiaccio per volere degli dei. Con l'aiuto del Re Scimmia, il bimbo ora rappresenta l'unica speranza per il suo villaggio."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Monkey King: Hero Is Back","overview":"The all-powerful Monkey King once roamed freely between Heaven and Earth, but after angering the Gods, he was imprisoned within an ice cage deep within the mountains. 500 years later, monsters attack a small village and a child flees to the mountains. Unknowingly, the child releases the Monkey King from his curse. With the help and encouragement from this special child, Monkey King saves the village from the evil monsters."},{"language":"zh-CN","title":"西游记之大圣归来","overview":"五百年前，齐天大圣孙悟空大闹天宫，最终被镇压在五行山下。五百年后，山妖四处掳掠童男童女，自幼由行脚僧法明抚养长大的江流儿在逃亡途中误入五行山，阴差阳错解开了孙悟空的封印。然而重获自由的大圣早已不复当年，法力依然受到束缚，只想尽快回到花果山。为了偿还江流儿的人情，他只得勉强护送江流儿和救下的小女孩踏上归途。一路相处中，始终把齐天大圣视作英雄的江流儿不断靠近这个失意而暴躁的孙悟空，而隐藏在暗处的妖王混沌也仍在追寻被救走的孩子。一段属于昔日英雄与小小少年共同的冒险由此展开……","tagline":"这是一个需要英雄的时代"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z7JdY5VcfqMEESYZ5WHzamkjth4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xESy6kg2k4JsGzHU0ILkOL9qYec.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":351694,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"zh-CN","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z7JdY5VcfqMEESYZ5WHzamkjth4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z7JdY5VcfqMEESYZ5WHzamkjth4.jpg","language":"it",